    "20日强弱排序，每20个交易日切到最强资产，需站上MA60，否则空仓；收益弹性高，但历史最大回撤显著高于其他精选策略。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ranks assets by 20-day relative strength and rotates into the leader every 20 trading sessions, provided it is above its 60-day moving average; otherwise the strategy moves to cash. This higher-return profile has historically experienced materially larger drawdowns than the other Featured strategies."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "20日强弱排序，每20个交易日切到最强资产，需站上MA60，否则空仓；收益弹性高，但历史最大回撤显著高于其他精选策略。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "20日強弱排序，每20個交易日切到最強資產，需站上MA60，否則空倉；收益彈性高，但歷史最大回撤顯著高於其他精選策略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
