    "可同时勾选多种资产；初始资金会按资产数量平均分配，每种资产独立执行同一套买卖规则。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Multiple assets can be selected at the same time; the initial funds will be evenly distributed according to the number of assets, and each asset will independently execute the same set of buying and selling rules."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可同时勾选多种资产；初始资金会按资产数量平均分配，每种资产独立执行同一套买卖规则。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可同時勾選多種資產；初始資金會以資產數量平均分配，且每種資產獨立執行同一套買賣規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
