    "更重视持有体验：黄金73%、标普1%、纳指26%，需站上MA220且120日动量为正；权益从180日高点回撤超过6%/12%时分级降仓，优先转向黄金或现金。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Designed for a smoother holding experience: 73% gold, 1% S&P 500, and 26% Nasdaq. Assets must be above their 220-day moving averages with positive 120-session momentum. Equity exposure is reduced in stages after 6% and 12% drawdowns from 180-session highs, with proceeds shifted to gold or cash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更重视持有体验：黄金73%、标普1%、纳指26%，需站上MA220且120日动量为正；权益从180日高点回撤超过6%/12%时分级降仓，优先转向黄金或现金。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
