            "value": "Monthly Candidate: Follow the popularity cap meta-strategy framework, but check it approximately every 30 trading days; increase the single equity cap to 72%, retain the gold satellite, February weak braking and net value light braking, and pursue a smoother full-cycle drawdown."
          }
        },
