    "防守发动机：保留双守门动量主体，并在持有期间检查高位破位、短动量转弱和相对黄金落后；多项风险同时出现时先锁盈降仓。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defensive engine: retain the main body of double gatekeeper momentum, and check for high position breaks, short-term momentum weakening and relative gold lagging during the holding period; when multiple risks appear at the same time, first lock in profits and reduce positions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防守发动机：保留双守门动量主体，并在持有期间检查高位破位、短动量转弱和相对黄金落后；多项风险同时出现时先锁盈降仓。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防守引擎：保留雙守門動量主體，並在持有期間檢查高位破位、短動量轉弱和相對黃金落後；多項風險同時出現時先鎖盈降倉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
