    "黄金/纳指双资产择强：近20日涨幅需超过2%，且站上MA250；每40个交易日切到更强资产，目标波动8%，最高投入90%": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gold/Nasdaq dual asset selection: the increase in the past 20 days must exceed 2% and stand above MA250; switch to stronger assets every 40 trading days, with a target volatility of 8%, and a maximum investment of 90%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "黄金/纳指双资产择强：近20日涨幅需超过2%，且站上MA250；每40个交易日切到更强资产，目标波动8%，最高投入90%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "黃金/納指雙資產擇強：近20日漲幅需超過2%，且站上MA250；每40個交易日切到更強資產，目標波動8%，最高投入90%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
